            <note corresp="#d266-f1" n="89" xml:id="d266-f1-content">
                <p>On July 31; for texts of the official Italian and German communiqués, see <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Documents on International Affairs, 1936</hi>, pp. 219
                    and 220.</p>
